Project Blueprint: Hinglish Voice Recovery Agent
Track: Track 03 — AI Revenue Recovery (Razorpay AI Buildathon)

Core Objective: Build an automated conversational AI agent using natural spoken Hinglish to detect failed/at-risk payments, diagnose root causes, and execute bounded recovery workflows at zero software cost.

1. Executive Summary & Core Concept
Hinglish Voice Recovery replaces passive, low-conversion reminder SMS/emails with real-time, interactive, voice-based outreach. The agent dynamically code-switches between Hindi and English, detects the failure reason (e.g., daily UPI limit hit, network drop, or forgotten renewal), triggers immediate remediation actions (such as sending a direct WhatsApp/SMS payment link via Razorpay APIs), and schedules Promise-to-Pay (PTP) retry sequences with strict compliance guardrails.

