3. Core Tool Definitions (Agent Function Calling)
The voice agent executes actions during calls by triggering backend webhook endpoints:

send_payment_link(phone_number, amount, method): Dispatches a dynamic Razorpay payment link via WhatsApp or SMS immediately when customer agrees to pay.

schedule_ptp_retry(customer_id, agreed_date_time): Records a Promise-to-Pay timestamp (e.g., "Kal subah 10 baje try kijiye") and queues an automated retry or reminder mandate.

mark_opt_out(customer_id, reason): Immediately flags the contact as DND / Do-Not-Disturb and halts all future automated outbound interactions.

escalate_to_human(customer_id, issue_type): Routes complex disputes (e.g., duplicate charges, pending bank refunds) to support desk queues.

4. Agent System Prompt & Guardrail Guidelines
Language & Persona: Speak natural, polite Indian Hinglish (e.g., "Namaste! Aapka order payment complete nahi ho paya tha. Kya main instant UPI link WhatsApp par share kar doon?"). Keep voice responses concise (1–2 sentences max).

Compliance Stopping Rules: If the user expresses hesitation or asks to stop (e.g., "Call mat karo / Not interested"), apologize once, call mark_opt_out, and gracefully disconnect.

Security Invariants: The voice agent is strictly forbidden from asking for, reading, or accepting OTPs, card CVVs, or bank passwords.

Outreach Frequency Bounds: Maximum 2 outbound call attempts per customer in any 24-hour rolling window.

5. End-to-End Workflow & Life Cycle
Trigger: Razorpay webhook notifies backend of a failed payment (payment.failed) or overdue invoice.

Queue & Call: Backend schedules an outbound call via voice provider.

Diagnostic Conversation: Agent determines the obstacle (e.g., UPI daily limit exceeded vs. busy schedule).

Remediation: Agent triggers send_payment_link or schedule_ptp_retry.

Audit & Settlement: Complete audio transcript, tool calls, and recovered amount recorded in PostgreSQL.

6. Meeting Track 03 Evaluation Bar ("The Bar")
Batch Simulation: Pre-load 25–50 synthetic failed transactions representing distinct decline scenarios.

Measured Recovery Metrics: Dashboard reports gross money recovered, conversion rate %, and drop-off reasons.

Full Audit Trail: Every action is fully explainable, bounded, gated, and displayed with timestamps in the web interface.